  (text "C3 at PS1 pins 1-2, C5 at pin 4 (C6, the LDO input cap, is the +V bulk).  Load: +V ~9 mA (LDO -> U1, U9, U4), -V ~1.5 mA (U5, U8): below the 10 % minimum load" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 165.1 114.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "09a4cfed-9db8-5af2-95a5-7204e97a658d"))
  (text "of the Mornsun A0515S on the -V rail since the -5 V zener chain went (M4c); fit the RECOM RB-0515D/HP (0 % min load) or batteries." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 165.1 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0d52b0a1-2503-544d-b2b9-288c6b679dd8"))
