  (text "Decoupling at: C10 U4 VDD, C9 U4 VREFIO, C13/C14 (+/-V) on the west feed near U6.  DAC60501Z: I2C address 0x48; write GAIN (0x04) = 0x0100 first, then DAC (0x08) = code << 4." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "66feb597-0042-5dd3-be6d-f0c89afdaaf4"))
  (text "VSET_P = 0..1.25 V.  U6 sw 2: CATH picks VSET_P (0) / VSET_N (1) -> SW_P; sw 1: EN picks 0 V (0) / SW_P (1) -> V_IN.  EN low (isolator fail-safe) = zero current." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 256.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3c8d5b0f-f65d-5ad4-a05c-b04139106100"))
  (text "Firmware: set CATH before raising EN, hold it until EN falls.  ADG1436 EN pin tied high: EN low would float V_IN." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 261.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "005c2d18-7b5a-53df-8630-8669dfba031a"))
  (rectangle (start 248.92 152.4) (end 347.98 254) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "78d0330b-284e-5383-9f0e-c35b46f3e6bc"))
  (text "4. OUTPUT STAGE  (floating-load V->I, I = V_IN / R_SENSE)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 250.19 156.21 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ac2be26a-903a-5c26-b94c-9832ff2f5ab2"))
