  (text "U8 runs from +/-V and compares E1 with taps 0.043 x (V+ + |V-|) inside each rail: |E1| > 0.915 V for equal packs (13.9 V at +/-15 V)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 358.14 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "376f30dc-ca71-56ec-92b1-a6b7ad9d60d4"))
  (text "FAULT_n low while E1 is past the trip point (a few us before U5A saturates; open electrode: within ~5 us of EN), while" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 358.14 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "aaf4baa4-3433-5238-ba54-c247bd41d8d6"))
